<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">- Dawuro Full Bible Latin Version</book>
  <para style="h">2 S'imootoosa</para>
  <para style="toc1">P'awuloosi S'imootoosaw S'aafeedda Laa'entso Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 S'imootoosa</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 S'im.</para>
  <para style="mt2">P'awuloosi</para>
  <para style="mt1">S'imootoosaw</para>
  <para style="mt2">S'aafeedda Laa'entso Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="imt">Geluwaa</para>
  <para style="ip">Hawe P'awuloosi S'imootoosaw s'aafeedda laa'entso kiitay, P'awuloosi mata barena maaddiyaanne oosuwaa barenanna ittippe ootsiyaa wodalla, S'imootoosa zoreedda zoriyaa oyk'k'eeddawaa. Aa zoriyaappe dariyaa baggay danddayaan genc'c'ana bessee giyaawaa. S'imootoosaw zoriyaanne mentsetsuwaa k'aalay imetteeddawe, Yesuusi Kiristtoosabaa ammanettiyaawaa gidiide markkattanaadan, Mishiraachchuwaa K'aalaanne Ec'a K'aalaa C'aak'uwaa timirttiyaa minisiide oyk'k'anaadaaninne metiyaabaynne ek'ettiyaabay darooppekka tamaarissiyaawaaninne Mishiraachchuwaa K'aalaa odiyaawaan minnanaassa.</para>
  <para style="ip">S'imootoosi eeyatetsaan oosettiyaa patsenna mela palumaappe haakkana mala, dumma mino oduu aw odetteedda. Ayaw gooppe, hewaa mala oduu sisiyaawantta bayizziyaawaappe attin, hara I immiyaa go"i baawa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hewan ubbaan S'imootoosi hassayanaw bessiyaabay P'awuloosa de'uwaanne Aa hanotaa lo"o k'ofaa, hewaappekka Aa ammanuwaa, Aa genc'c'uwaa, Aa siik'uwaa Aa danddayaanne yedesaan Aa gakkeedda metuwaa leemisuwaan kaallanaadaana.</para>
  <para style="iot">Shemppatuwaa Ubbatoo Imetteedda K'antsa K'ofatuwaa</para>
  <para style="io1">Geluwaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">S'imootoosaw imetteedda mak'k'uwaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 1:3-2:13">1:3—2:13</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Asay kaddiyaa wode ammanetti beettussa <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 2:14-4:5">2:14—4:5</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">He wode de'iyaabatuwaanne koshshiyaa kaaletsiyaa ogatuwaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 4:6-18">4:6-18</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Wurssetsaa k'utiyaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 4:19-22">4:19-22</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1"/>Taani P'awuloosi, S'oossay immana geedda Kiristtoosi Yesuusanna nuw de'iyaa de'uwaabaa odanaw, S'oossay geeddawaadan, Kiristtoosi Yesuusi kiitteeddawe, <verse eid="2TI 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2"/>ta siik'o na'aa S'imootoosaw ha dabddaabbiyaa s'aafay.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="2TI 1:2">S'imootoosaw Imetteedda Zoriyaa</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 1:2">S'oossaa Aawuwaappenne nu Godaa Kiristtoosi Yesuusappe, aad'd'o keekatetsay, maarotetsaynne sarotetsay new gido.<verse eid="2TI 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3"/>Ta zaratuu ootseeddawaadan, taanikka taana zoriyaa geeshsha wozanaappe ootsiyaa S'oossaa k'ammanne gallassi woossiyaa woosaan ubbaa wode neena hassayiyaa diraw, Aa galatay. <verse eid="2TI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4"/>Taani ne afotsaa hassaya hassayaade nashettana mala, neena be'anaw daro laamotay.<verse eid="2TI 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5"/>Neenan de'iyaa worddo baynna ammanuwaa hassayay. He ammanuu beni ne daay daay Loydininne ne daay Ewuniik'in de'iyaa ammanuwaa mala; k'ay neenankka hewe de'iyaawaa eraad. <verse eid="2TI 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6"/>Hewaa diraw, taani ta kushiyaa laa"uwaa ne bolla wotseedda wode,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Taani ta kushiyaa laa"uwaa ne bolla wotseedda wode: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hawe bessiyaawe, ammaniyaa asaa kaaletsanaadan Geeshsha Ayyaanay oosoo doorina tumatetsaan kaaletsiyaawanttu K'aalaa odanaw woy tamaarissanaw S'oossay okkeeddawanttu bollan barenttu kushiyaa wotsiide woossiyaawaa bessee. </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 1:4">1 S'im. 1:4</ref></char> S'eellite.</note> S'oossay new immeedda imuwaa neeni doshissenna mala, neena hassayissay. <verse eid="2TI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7"/>Ayaw gooppe, S'oossay nuw wolk'k'aa, siik'uwaanne nu huup'iyaa naagiyaawaa immiyaa Geeshsha Ayaanaa immeeddappe attin, yashshaa ayaanaa immibeenna.<verse eid="2TI 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8"/>Simmi, nu Godaw markkattiyaawaan woy Aa diraw k'ashuwaan de'iyaa tawaankka yeellatoppa. Shin S'oossay new immiyaa wolk'k'aa keenaan taananna mishiraachchuwaa k'aalaw waayetta. <verse eid="2TI 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9"/>S'oossay bare k'ofaaninne bare aad'd'o keekatetsan nuuna ashshiide, bare asaa ootsanaw s'eesowaappe attin, nuuni ootseedda oosuwaa diraw gidenna. I ha aad'd'o keekatetsaa Kiristtoosi Yesuusa baggana wodii doomettanaappe kase nuw immeedda. <verse eid="2TI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10"/>Shin ha"i ha aad'd'o keekatetsay nuuna ashshiyaa Kiristtoosi Yesuusa yuussaan nuw k'onc'c'eedda. K'ay hayk'uwaa wolk'k'aakka I d'ayisseedda. Wonggalaa mishiraachchuwaa baggana bayenna de'uwaa nuw k'onc'c'isseedda.<verse eid="2TI 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11"/>Taani Yesuusi kiitteeddawaanne Ayihuda gidenna asaa tamaarissiyaawaa gidaade, wonggalaa mishiraachchuwaa odana mala, S'oossay taana dooreedda. <verse eid="2TI 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12"/>K'ay taani ha metuwaa akkiyaawe hewaa diraassa. Shin taani ammaneeddawaa eriyaa diraw, yeellatikke. K'ay I taw immeedda hadaraa he gallassay gakkanaw, I naaganaw danddayiyaawaa eray.<verse eid="2TI 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13"/>Taani neena tamaarisseedda tumu k'aalaa leemisuwaa uda oyk'k'aade, Kiristtoosi Yesuusan nuw de'iyaa ammanuwaaninne siik'uwaan de'a. <verse eid="2TI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14"/>Nu giddon de'iyaa Geeshsha Ayaanaa baggana new hadaraa immeedda lo"obaa naaga.<verse eid="2TI 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15"/>Iisiyaa giyaa biittaan de'iyaa ubbatuu taappe bak'ateeddawaa eraasa; unttunttu giddon Pigeluusinne Hermogeneesi de'iino.<verse eid="2TI 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16"/>Henesifooru taana daro wode mentsetseedda diraw, Goday Aa soy asaw maarotetsaa immo. K'ay taani k'asho gollen de'iyaawaa I yeellatibeenna. <verse eid="2TI 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17"/>Shin Roome giyaa katamaa gakkeeddasaanna taana loytsi koyyiide demmeedda. <verse eid="2TI 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18"/>He gallassi Godaappe maarotetsaa demmanaadan, Goday aw immo. K'ay Efesoona giyaa katamaan I taana ay keenaa maaddeeddenttonne neeni loytsa eraasa.<verse eid="2TI 1:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2"/>
  <para style="s">Kiristtoosaw Lo"o Wotaadara Gidiide Metuwaa Akkiyaawaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1"/>Simmi ta na'aw, Kiristtoosi Yesuusan de'iyaa aad'd'o keekatetsan minna. <verse eid="2TI 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2"/>K'ay daro markkatuu de'iyaa saan taappe neeni siseedda yewatuwaa haratuwaa tamaarissanaw danddayiyaa ammanetteeda asatoo hadaraa imma.<verse eid="2TI 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3"/>Kiristtoosa Yesuusaw ammanetteeda wotaadaraadan, taananna waayetta. <verse eid="2TI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4"/>Olaa biyaa wotaadaray bare kaappuwaa nashechchanaw, wotaadara gidenna Asay ootsiyaa kiitaan walakettenna. <verse eid="2TI 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5"/>K'ay wotsaan keesetiyaa uraykka wogaadan wos's'ana d'ayooppe, woytaa akkena. <verse eid="2TI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6"/>Daro daaburiide ootseedda biittaa goshiyaa bitanii shiik'eedda katsaappe barena gakkiyaawaa koyro akkanaw bessee. <verse eid="2TI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7"/>Neeni ubbabaa akeekanaadan, Goday neena danddayissana diraw, taani giyaawaa k'oppa.<verse eid="2TI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8"/>Taani wonggalaa mishiraachchuwaa odiyaawaadan, hayk'uwaappe denddeedda Daawite zariyaa Yesuusi Kiristtoosa k'oppa. <verse eid="2TI 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9"/>Taani wonggalaa mishiraachchuwaa odiyaa diraw, iitabaa ootseeddawaadan, haray atto k'ashettana gakkanaw waayettay. Shin S'oossaa k'aalay k'ashettenna. <verse eid="2TI 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10"/>Hewaa diraw, taani S'oossay dooreedda asatuukka Kiristtoosi Yesuusan de'iyaa atotetsaa med'inaa bonchchuwaanna demmanaadan, unttunttu diraw, taani ubbabaan waayettay.<verse eid="2TI 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11"/>Hawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">«Nuuni aanana ittippe hayk'k'eeddawaa gidooppe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:11">aanana ittippe de'ana.<verse eid="2TI 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12"/>Nuuni genc'c'ooppe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">aanana ittippe kaatetana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">Nuuni Aa kaddooppe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">ikka nuuna kaddana.<verse eid="2TI 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13"/>Nuuni ammanettennaan aggooppekka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">I ammanettiyaawaa gidiide de'anawaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:13">Ayaw gooppe, I barena bare huup'ew</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">erikke gaanaw danddayenna»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2TI 2:13">giyaawe tumu haasaya.<verse eid="2TI 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mino Oosanchchaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14"/>Neeni ne asaa hawaa hassayissa; unttunttu k'aalaan palumettenna mala, S'oossaa sintsan zora. Hewe sisiyaa asaa bayizziyaawaappe attin, ayinne go"enna. <verse eid="2TI 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15"/>Neeni S'oossaa tumatetsaa k'aalaa suuretetsaan odiyaawaanne k'ay Aa oosoo yeellatenna oosanchcha gidaade, S'oossay sabbiyaa asaadan, ne huup'iyaa S'oossaw immanaw minna. <verse eid="2TI 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16"/>Shin ha sa'aw injjetiyaa maaddenna haasayaappe neena naaga. Ayaw gooppe, hewe S'oossaappe asaa haassee. <verse eid="2TI 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17"/>K'ay unttunttu tamaarissiyaawe bollaa c'ittuwaadan ubbasaa gakkanaassa. He tamaarissiyaawanttuppe laa"atuu Hemeneyoosanne Piliis'oosa. <verse eid="2TI 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18"/>Unttunttu tumuwaa ogiyaa aggiide, «Hayk'uwaappe denddiyaawe kase aad'd'idiggeedda» yaagiide amareeda ammaniyaa asatuwaa ammanuwaa bayizziino.<verse eid="2TI 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19"/>Gidooppekka, S'oossay esseedda mino tuussay k'aas's'ana danddayenna. K'ay Aa bollan, «Goday barewantta eree»; k'ay «Godaawaa gidiyaa ooninne iita oosuwaa aggo» yaagiyaa K'aalatuu s'aafetteeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:5">Pay. 16:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="2TI 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20"/>Itti wolk'k'aama gollen work'k'aappenne biraappe med'etteedda miishshaa s'alalaa gidennaan, mitsaappenne urk'k'aappe med'etteedda miishshatuukka de'iino. Hewanttuppe baggatuu bonchcho oosuwaa unttunttun ootsanaw, k'ay baggatuu tooshettiyaabaa unttunttun ootsanaw med'etteeddino. <verse eid="2TI 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21"/>Hewaa diraw, ooninne ha iitabaa ubbaappe barena geeshshooppe, I bare Godaa go"iyaa oosuwaa ootsanaw barena immeedda diraw, bonchcho oosuwaa ootsiyaa miishshaa gidanawaa. K'ay lo"o oosuwaa ubbaa ootsanaw giigetteeddawaa gidanawaa.<verse eid="2TI 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22"/>Shin neeni iita wodallatetsaa amuwaappe bak'ata. Barentta maaddanaw geeshsha wozanaappe Godaa s'eesisiyaawanttunna ittippe, s'illotetsaa, ammanuwaa, siik'otetsaanne sarotetsaa minisaade kaala.<verse eid="2TI 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23"/>Shin eeyatuwaa palumiinne ayinne erennawanttu palumii walassaa kaaletsiyaawaa eraade aappe bak'ata. <verse eid="2TI 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24"/>Godaa k'oomay ubbaw keekiyaawaa, loytsi tamaarissiyaawaanne danddayanchcha gidanaw besseeppe attin, walak'ettanaw bessena. <verse eid="2TI 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25"/>K'ay I barena is's'iyaawantta ashikketetsan seeriyaawaa gidanaw bessee. Unttunttu barenttu nagaraappe simmiide, tumatetsaa eranaadan S'oossay ootsanentto, ooni eri. <verse eid="2TI 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26"/>K'ay unttunttu barenttu wozanaa k'ofaw simmiide, unttuntta bare koyyeeddabaw azazettana mala oyk'k'eedda s'alahiyaa kaappuwaa dabaappe kessi akkana.<verse eid="2TI 2:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3"/>
  <para style="s">Wurssetsa Gallassatuwaan Hananaw <optbreak/>De'iyaa Iita Yewatuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1"/>Shin wurssetsa gallassi waayissiyaa wodii yaanawaa akeeka. <verse eid="2TI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2"/>Ayaw gooppe, Asay barena siik'iyaawantta, shaluwaa siik'iyaawantta, c'eek'ettiyaawantta, ayyiyaawantta, boriyaawantta, barena yeleeddawanttoo azazettenawantta, galatennawantta, geeshshatetsay baynnawantta, <verse eid="2TI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3"/>siik'uu baynnawantta, sigettennawantta, zigirssanchchatuwaa, barena naagennawantta, keekennawantta, lo"obaa dosennawantta, <verse eid="2TI 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4"/>ubbaa erikke giyaawantta, dirbbiyaawantta, otoruwaan sugettiyaawantta, k'ay S'oossaappe aatsiide, ishaluwaa dosiyaawantta gidana. <verse eid="2TI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5"/>Unttunttu S'oossaw goyinniyaawaa malatiino; shin Aa wolk'k'aa kaddeeddino. Hewanttu mala asatuwaakko shiik'oppa.<verse eid="2TI 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6-7"/>Ayaw gooppe, unttunttuppe ittuu ittuu asaa golliyaa geliide, nagaray dees'eeddawantta, dumma dumma amuwaan sugettiyaawantta, ubbaa wode tamaariide, tumatetsaa era akkanaw mule danddayibeenna daaburanchcha mac'c'awantta baletsiino. <verse eid="2TI 3:6-7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8"/>Yaaneesinne Yambbareesi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yaaneesinne Yambbareesi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsatuu Ec'a C'aak'uwaa Mas'aafan baawa. Shin c'ora Asay giyaa k'ofay, «Hawanttu Muse Israa'eeliyaa asaa Gibs'eppe kessiide kaaletsanaw k'oppeedda wode, aanana ek'etteedda muruniyaawantta» yaagiyaawaana. </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 7:11">Kes. 7:11</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 7:12">12</ref></char> s'eellite.</note> Muse yewuwaa p'alk'k'owaadan, hewaadan k'ay hawanttu, suure k'ofay baynnawantta ammanuwaan kunddeeddawanttu, tumatetsaabaa p'alk'k'iino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:11">Kes. 7:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9"/>Shin Yaaneesa eeyatetsaynne Yambbareesa eeyatetsay k'ay k'onc'c'eeddawaadan, unttunttu eeyatetsaykka asaa ubbaw k'onc'c'ana diraw, unttunttu kasewaappe aad'd'iide dic'c'ikkino.<verse eid="2TI 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wurssetsa Zoriyaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10"/>Shin neeni ta timirttiyaa, ta hanotaanne ta k'ofaa, ta ammanuwaanne ta danddayaa, ta siik'uwaanne ta genc'c'uwaa, <verse eid="2TI 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11"/>ta yedesaanne ta waayiyaa be'aadda. Ans's'ookiyaanne, Ik'ooniyoonenne Liss's'iraa giyaa katamatuwaan taana gakkeeddabaanne taani danddayeedda yedesaa eraasa. Goday taana he ubbaappe ashsheeda. <verse eid="2TI 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12"/>Tumatetsaan Kiristtoosi Yesuusan S'oossaa malatiide de'anaw dosiyaa ubbay yederssettana. <verse eid="2TI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13"/>Shin iita asatuunne baletsiyaawanttu haratuwaa baletsiiddenne barenttu huup'ew baliidde, kaseppe iiti iiti biino.<verse eid="2TI 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14"/>Shin neeni he tumatetsaa ooppe tamaareeddenttonne eraade, neeni tamaareeddawaaninne ereeddawaan minnaade de'a. <verse eid="2TI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15"/>Neeni guutsa na'atetsaappe doommaade Kiristtoosi Yesuusa ammanaade, atotetsay beettiyaa aad'd'eedda eraa immanaw danddayiyaa Geeshsha Mas'aafatuwaa eraadda. <verse eid="2TI 3:15"/><verse number="16-17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16-17"/>S'oossaa Mas'aafaa ubbaan S'oossaa Ayyaanay de'ee. K'ay he mas'aafatuu S'oossaw ootsiyaa Asay kumentsanne lo"o oosuwaa ubbaw giigeeddawaa gidana mala, tumatetsaa tamaarissanaw, balaa seeranaw, bayizzuwaa suurissanawunne s'illotetsaa de'oo zoriyaa immanaw maaddiino.<verse eid="2TI 3:16-17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1"/>Taani neena S'oossaa sintsaaninne, de'uwaan de'iyaa asaanne hayk'k'eedda asaa pirddanaw de'iyaa Kiristtoosi Yesuusa sintsan, k'ay Aa yuussaaninne Aa kawutetsaan neena zoray. <verse eid="2TI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2"/>K'aalaa oda. Wodii injjetina injjetana d'ayina, minnaade oda. Daro danddayan asaa tamaarissaadde suurissa, seeranne zora. <verse eid="2TI 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3"/>Ayaw gooppe, Asay tumu timirttiyaa sisennaan is's'iyaa wodii yaanawaa. Shin Asay barenttu amuwaa kaalliide, sisanaw nashechchiyaawaa odiyaa tamaarissiyaawantta gujji gujji shiishshana. <verse eid="2TI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4"/>Unttunttu tumu yewuwaa sisiyaawaa aggiide, tossaa sisanaw barenttu haytsaa wora zaarana. <verse eid="2TI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5"/>Shin neeni ubbabaan ne huup'iyaa naaganaw bessee. Waayiyaa danddaya. Wonggalaa mishiraachchuwaa odiyaawe ootsiyaa oosuwaa ootsa. S'oossaa k'oomaadan, ne ootsiyaa oosuwaa ubbaa pola.<verse eid="2TI 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6"/>Taana gidooppe, ta suutsay gukkiide yarshshettiyaa wodiinne k'ay ha de'uwaa aggaade biyaa wodii gakkeedda. <verse eid="2TI 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7"/>Taani lo"o baas'iyaa baas'etaaddi; wotsaa wos's'aadde wurssaad; ammanuwaakka naagaad. <verse eid="2TI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8"/>Sintsappe taw s'illotetsaa kalachchay giigi utteedda. Hewaa s'illo pirddaa pirddiyaa Goday he gallassi taw immana. K'ay Kiristtoosi k'onc'c'anawaa dosiyaa ubba saappe attin, ta s'alalaassa gidenna.<verse eid="2TI 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aa Buzo Allaallatuwabaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9"/>Taakko ellekka yaanaw minna. <verse eid="2TI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10"/>Ayaw gooppe, Deemaasi ha alamiyaa dosiide, taana aggiide, Teselonk'k'e giyaa katamaa beedda. K'erk'k'iisi Galaatiyaa giyaa gadiyaa biina, k'ay Tiito Dilmaas'iyaa giyaa gadiyaa beedda. <verse eid="2TI 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11"/>Luk'aasa s'alalay taananna de'ee. Mark'k'oossi taana kiitaan loytsi maaddanaw danddayiyaa diraw, Aa demmaade neenanna akkaade ya. <verse eid="2TI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12"/>Shin taani Tikik'oosa Efesoona giyaa katamaa kiittaad. <verse eid="2TI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13"/>Neeni yaadde, S'iro'aadaa giyaa katamaan Karppoosawan taani yeggaade yeedda ta gaabiyaanne k'ay mas'aafatuwaa taw akkaade ya. Shin dummayaade galbbaan s'aafetteedda mas'aafatuwaa ayaa giddoppenne, akkenaan yooppa.<verse eid="2TI 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14"/>Birataa k'os's'iyaa Iskkinddiri taana daro k'oheedda; Goday aw Aa oosuwaadan zaarana. <verse eid="2TI 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15"/>I nuuni odiyaawaa loytsi p'alk'k'iyaa diraw, neeni aappe neena naaga.<verse eid="2TI 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16"/>Koyro taana mootiyaa wode, ubbaykka aggeeddawaappe attin, taana ooninne maaddibeenna. S'oossay hewaa unttunttoo paydoppo. <verse eid="2TI 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17"/>Shin taani kumentsaa kiitaa Ayihuda gidenna Asay ubbay sisanaw odana mala, Goday ta matan ek'k'iide, taw wolk'k'aa immeedda. K'ay gaammuwaa doonaappekka taana ashsheeda. <verse eid="2TI 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18"/>Goday taana iitabaa ubbaappe ashshiide, bare saluwaa kawutetsaa sarotetsaan afana; aw med'i med'inaw bonchchuu gido. Amen"i.<verse eid="2TI 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wurssetsa Sarotaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19"/>P'irisk'k'illiw, Ak'iilassinne Henesifooru soy asaw ta sarotaa oda. <verse eid="2TI 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20"/>Erass's'oosi K'oronttoosa giyaa katamaan atteedda. Shin S'irofiimoosi saketteedda diraw, Miliis'e giyaa katamaan Aa wotsaad. <verse eid="2TI 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21"/>Balgguu wod'd'anaappe kase yaanaw minna.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:21">Ewubuluusi, P'udeesi, Liinoosinne K'ilawude k'ay hara ishatuu ubbaykka neena saro saro giino.<verse eid="2TI 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22"/>Goday ne ayyaanaanna gido. Aad'o keekatetsay hinttenanna ubbaanna gido. Amen"i.<verse eid="2TI 4:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4"/>
</usx>
